{"id":"n41163-1-9","stage":0,"title":"냄비 · 小锅","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41163-1-9-1","ko":"승규야, 냄비를 써야 하니 설거지 좀 하거라.","zh":"承奎，要用这口锅了，去把它洗一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"냄비를","meaning":"这口锅","explanation":"냄비：烹饪用的锅；-를 标记需要使用的东西。","readings":[{"term":"냄비","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41163","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄비를","audio":"/audio/825364cfbdc9c212ab83.mp3"}},{"text":"써야","meaning":"要用","explanation":"쓰다：使用；-어야 与 하다 合用表示必须。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써야","audio":"/audio/3eeba0baa1ae7cce1a5b.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"因为得……","explanation":"-어야 하다 表示必须；-니 在这里说明洗锅的原因。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"설거지","meaning":"清洗餐具、锅","explanation":"설거지：洗用过的餐具或锅具；这里是为使用锅而清洗。","readings":[{"term":"설거지","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62246","senseId":"1","lemma":"설거지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설거지","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：在请求中使语气更柔和。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"하거라.","meaning":"去洗吧","explanation":"설거지하다：清洗餐具；-거라 是对晚辈的非敬语指示。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하거라","audio":"/audio/ac5fb3f9b93a70b54aae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"61c1473461c3ddf8","term":"냄비","zh":"锅、汤锅","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3","entryId":"41163","definition":"烹饪用的带把手的锅；这里是需要先洗的锅。","pronunciation":["냄비"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"43618b069071a4b4","term":"설거지","zh":"洗餐具、洗锅","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3","entryId":"62246","definition":"清洗餐具和烹饪器具；这里是把要用的锅洗干净。","pronunciation":["설거지"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]}],"audio":"/audio/89b006d87a3d3501c797.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41163-1-9-2","ko":"예, 엄마.","zh":"好的，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예,","meaning":"好的","explanation":"예：对母亲的肯定回应。","readings":[{"term":"예","audio":"/audio/2eb73fba696e2fe4ea0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73966","senseId":"2","lemma":"예","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예","audio":"/audio/2eb73fba696e2fe4ea0a.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2eb73fba696e2fe4","term":"예","